{"id":"n66582-4-3","stage":2,"title":"인간 · 家伙","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66582-4-3-1","ko":"네가 바람을 피워서 승규랑 헤어진거라면서?","zh":"听说你劈腿了，才和承奎分手的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바람을","meaning":"外遇","explanation":"바람：外遇；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"3","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"피워서","meaning":"吸，抽","explanation":"피우다：吸，抽；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"피우다","audio":"/audio/6e1ba3221dbae36d0573.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73272","senseId":"6","lemma":"피우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승규랑","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"승규랑","audio":"/audio/6fee231a092f9f8d9b8c.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"헤어진거라면서?","meaning":"分手，分开，走开；某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"헤어지다：分手，分开，走开；거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라면서：引用听来的名词判断或命令，向对方确认；加 요 更礼貌。","readings":[{"term":"헤어지다","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3"},{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58271","senseId":"2","lemma":"헤어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"外遇","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"85627","definition":"偷偷和其他异性相爱。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"6e1ba3221dbae36d","term":"피우다","zh":"吸，抽","audio":"/audio/6e1ba3221dbae36d0573.mp3","entryId":"73272","definition":"给某个物质点上火，把冒出的烟吸入之后又吐出来。","pronunciation":["피우다"]},{"id":"55df2acaad2147f2","term":"헤어지다","zh":"分手，分开，走开","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3","entryId":"58271","definition":"和亲近的人切断关系。","pronunciation":["헤어지다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/dc2977be0c2c258ddaac.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66582-4-3-2","ko":"어디서 그런 이야기를 들었어요? 어떤 인간이 그래요?","zh":"从哪里听来的？哪个家伙说的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이야기를","meaning":"消息","explanation":"이야기：消息；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"4","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었어요?","meaning":"听说","explanation":"듣다：听说；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"某个","explanation":"어떤：某个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"3","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인간이","meaning":"家伙","explanation":"인간：家伙；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"인간","audio":"/audio/93c03197da6febce72a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66582","senseId":"4","lemma":"인간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래요?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"ffe0179e59e74069","term":"이야기","zh":"消息","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3","entryId":"60321","definition":"某些东西的传闻或评判。","pronunciation":["이야기"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"某个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"没有必要明确地指出是哪个对象时使用的话。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"93c03197da6febce","term":"인간","zh":"家伙","audio":"/audio/93c03197da6febce72a4.mp3","entryId":"66582","definition":"(贬称)自己不满意的人。","pronunciation":["인간"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/b5124fff22c4d9d50960.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.248,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66582","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"중급","day":74,"sequenceScore":2.0747,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["从哪里听来的？哪个家伙说的？","今晚要一起看电影吗？","听说你劈腿了，才和承奎分手的？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["从哪里听来的？哪个家伙说的？","听说你劈腿了，才和承奎分手的？","今晚要一起看电影吗？"],"answer":0}]}
